TYPES.md §1, §7.4, EVALUATION.md §1: a bound building a later record checks its defaults first; a default outside its refinement is the record's E3204, once, and the bound reading it breaks silently (no E3015, no E3023).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local let n: Int(0..(T {}).u.y) = 1

local record T {
  u: U = {}
}

local record U {
  y: Int(1..) = 0
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3204]  a/a.canon:10:17
  0 is outside 1..
  expected by a/a.canon:10 (y: Int(1..))

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
